  "notes": "Year-1 Vault of Glass Hunter: the Prime Zealot set, The Last Word, Praedyth's Revenge, Corrective Measure. The one exotic is the weapon, so the armour is all legendary - one exotic weapon plus one exotic armour piece is the limit, and the validator warns rather than errors because we have never seen the 01.29 client enforce it. Era: each item's `era` field is the extractor's verdict from Bungie reward sources, and `sources_in_era` means 'NO EVIDENCE AGAINST', not 'confirmed present in 01.29' - the 2020 manifest has no date-added field. What is measured, not assumed, is that every gear item here carries qualityLevel > 0, the Year-1 marker (historicaldocs/design/loadout-framework.md §Era). Subclasses have qualityLevel 0 by construction and are exempt. Nothing in this file has been confirmed against the 01.29 client. [U] level 30 / light 30 are the Year-1 caps; 01.29 is a Rise of Iron build with a level-40 cap, and we have never observed what that client does with Year-1 gear.",
